# Unicode CLDR 47, locale hi, gregorian wide weekday names
# (cldr-json 47.0.0, cldr-dates-full/main/hi/ca-gregorian.json).
# Sense confirmed at en.wiktionary.org, entry “रविवार”.
# इतवार is the everyday colloquial name for the same day; en.wiktionary
# glosses it 'Sunday' and lists रविवार as its synonym.
रविवार
इतवार
